---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Sign Language Translator"
  description="Privacy policy for SignLanguage-Translator.com — what data we do and don't collect."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-slate-500">Last updated: October 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-slate-700">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">The short version</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This site has no accounts, no analytics that identify you, and no
          cookies of its own. Text you enter into the translator never leaves
          your browser — translation happens entirely on your device.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">What we don't collect</h2>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>No user accounts or profiles</li>
          <li>No tracking cookies set by this site</li>
          <li>No recording or storage of text you translate</li>
          <li>No voice recordings — voice input is processed by your browser's own speech recognition service</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Browser features</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The optional voice-input and listen-aloud features use your browser's
          built-in Web Speech API and speech synthesis. Those run between your
          browser and your device/operating-system services; we never see or
          store that data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Contacting us</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          If you email us, we receive your email address and message content, and
          use them only to reply. We don't sell, share, or add your details to
          any mailing list.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Server logs</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Our hosting provider may keep standard, anonymized server logs (such as
          requested pages and timestamps) for security and reliability. We don't
          combine these with any personal information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Changes</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          If this policy changes, the updated version will be posted here with a
          new date. Questions:{" "}
          <a class="font-semibold text-indigo-700 underline" href="mailto:fkdigitalmedia@gmail.com">
            fkdigitalmedia@gmail.com
          </a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
